      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial TiVNbTa alloy has a room-temperature yield strength of approximately 800 MPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiVNbTa baseline has a yield strength of approximately 330 MPa at 1273 K under the reported 30% strain condition.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial TiVNbTa alloy lacks secondary precipitates.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 2–5 at.% Al to TiVNbTa will promote precipitation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al addition will produce coherent L12-type precipitates in a BCC TiVNbTa matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting L12 precipitates will be nanoscale and uniformly dispersed.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al lowers the energetic barrier for precipitate formation in TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-induced secondary phases will remain stable at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitates will impede dislocation motion and thereby strengthen the alloy at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation strengthening is a viable strategy for improving the elevated-temperature strength of HEAs.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al-modified TiVNbTa will have greater yield strength at 1273 K than the 330 MPa baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yield strength of Al-modified TiVNbTa at 1273 K may exceed 400 MPa.",
